chnical Parameters:</strong></h3><table border="1" cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" width="710"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Specification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Appearance</td><td>Light brown powder</td></tr><tr><td>Particle Size</td><td>80–120 mesh</td></tr><tr><td>Moisture</td><td>≤ 10%</td></tr><tr><td>Crude Protein</td><td>≥ 30% (defatted); ≥ 18% (full-fat)</td></tr><tr><td>Crude Fiber</td><td>≥ 15%</td></tr><tr><td>Fat Content</td><td>≤ 10% (defatted); ≥ 30% (full-fat)</td></tr><tr><td>Shelf Life</td><td>18–24 months in cool, dry conditions</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"></div></div><hr class=""/><p class=""><strong>Why Choose Us?</strong></p><ul><li class="">Direct factory supply from Northern China’s flaxseed production base</li><li class="">Stable inventory &amp; customized specs for bulk buyers</li><li class="">OEM packaging and export-ready documents are available</li></ul><p class="">Contact us today for samples, COA, and a tailored quotation.</p>`} />
